{"id":"b2-u05","level":"b2","order":5,"title":{"en":"Telling the time","fr":"Dire l'heure","es":"Decir la hora","ar":"قول الوقت"},"tip":{"en":"Ask 'What time is it?' and answer 'It is three o'clock'. Use 'at' for an event: 'at seven', and 'from ... to ...' for a period: 'from nine to six'.","fr":"Demandez « Quelle heure est-il ? » et répondez « Il est trois heures ». Pour un moment précis, on dit « à sept heures », et pour une durée « de neuf heures à dix-huit heures ».","es":"Pregunta «¿Qué hora es?» y responde «Son las tres». Para un momento usa «a las siete», y para un periodo «de nueve a seis».","ar":"اسأل «كم الساعة؟» وأجب «الساعة الثالثة». للحدث نقول «في الساعة السابعة»، وللمدة «من التاسعة إلى السادسة»."},"words":36,"lessons":[{"id":"b2-u05-l1","type":"learn","order":1,"title":{"en":"hour, minute, quarter","fr":"heure, minute, quart","es":"la hora, el minuto, el cuarto","ar":"ساعة، دقيقة، ربع"},"count":11},{"id":"b2-u05-l2","type":"learn","order":2,"title":{"en":"midnight, morning, afternoon","fr":"minuit, matin, après-midi","es":"la medianoche, la mañana, la tarde","ar":"منتصف الليل، الصباح، بعد الظهر"},"count":10},{"id":"b2-u05-l3","type":"learn","order":3,"title":{"en":"late, on time, now","fr":"tard, à l'heure, maintenant","es":"tarde, a tiempo, ahora","ar":"متأخرا، في الوقت، الآن"},"count":11},{"id":"b2-u05-l4","type":"learn","order":4,"title":{"en":"after, from, until","fr":"après, de, jusqu'à","es":"después, desde, hasta","ar":"بعد، من، إلى"},"count":10},{"id":"b2-u05-l5","type":"learn","order":5,"title":{"en":"open, closed, to start","fr":"ouvert, fermé, commencer","es":"abierto, cerrado, empezar","ar":"مفتوح، مغلق، يبدأ"},"count":10},{"id":"b2-u05-l6","type":"learn","order":6,"title":{"en":"to wake up, to sleep, to wait","fr":"se réveiller, dormir, attendre","es":"despertarse, dormir, esperar","ar":"يستيقظ، ينام، ينتظر"},"count":9},{"id":"b2-u05-l7","type":"learn","order":7,"title":{"en":"bus, class, appointment","fr":"bus, cours, rendez-vous","es":"e